  m_text: 'Dear myself,

    If you are reading this... You might very well bear
    witness to the last Lightfire Beacon illuminating the unending Dark.

    Do
    not let it''s flame fade away!

    Use the help of the elements to defend the
    valley. Remember, You need to become stronger if you dare to survive till the
    end.

    Good luck!

    - The Lightfire Keeper'
